      "extract": "The extensive works of Dixon [@dixon2013division; @dixon1990derivation; @dixon2010division] focus on deriving the SM from tensor products of Hurwitz algebra. The approach is to reduce spinor spaces of Hurwitz algebras (as well as their associated action algebras) into sets of orthogonal subspaces. This is achieved by finding projection operators within the algebras, corresponding to primitive idempotents obtained",
